{"case_id": "sonde-01", "persona": "sante-2", "jour": "2026-11-18", "item": {"schema_version": "1.1", "item_id": "mail:sante-2-00374", "source": "mail", "provider": "demo", "owner_user_id": "u_train_sante_2", "title": "URGENT : présentation certification", "snippet": "Tu peux appeler Chloé Barbier pour savoir si elle est disponible pour la présentation pour la certification, avant jeudi 19 novembre? Jette aussi un œil à la pièce jointe. En priorité Bonne journée, Olivier", "content_text": null, "created_at": "2026-11-17T16:48:00+01:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-17T16:48:00+01:00", "start_at": null, "end_at": null, "due_at": null, "completed": null, "participants": [{"name": "Olivier Masson", "email": "olivier.masson@clinique-cedres.test", "role": "from"}, {"name": "Camille Roger", "email": "camille.roger@clinique-cedres.test", "role": "to"}], "thread_id": "thr-sante-2-c119", "correlation_id": null, "native_importance": "normal", "is_read": false, "url": "https://mail.clinique-cedres.test/owa/sante-2-00374", "acl": {"visible_to": ["u_train_sante_2"]}, "collected_at": "2026-11-17T16:48:00+01:00", "connector": {"name": "trainset", "version": "0.2.0"}, "attributes": null}}
{"case_id": "sonde-02", "persona": "qualite-3", "jour": "2026-11-04", "item": {"schema_version": "1.1", "item_id": "mail:qualite-3-00031", "source": "mail", "provider": "demo", "owner_user_id": "u_train_qualite_3", "title": "Relecture procédure non-conformités", "snippet": "J'ai finalisé la rédaction de la nouvelle procédure de traitement des non-conformités. Merci de la relire avant lundi 9 novembre, afin qu'on puisse la diffuser aux équipes. Tu trouveras le document dans le dossier partagé. Merci ! Rachid", "content_text": null, "created_at": "2026-11-03T13:15:00+01:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-03T13:15:00+01:00", "start_at": null, "end_at": null, "due_at": null, "completed": null, "participants": [{"name": "Rachid Nicolas", "email": "rachid.nicolas@precisium.test", "role": "from"}, {"name": "Rachid Denis", "email": "rachid.denis@precisium.test", "role": "to"}], "thread_id": "thr-qualite-3-c010", "correlation_id": null, "native_importance": "high", "is_read": false, "url": "https://mail.precisium.test/owa/qualite-3-00031", "acl": {"visible_to": ["u_train_qualite_3"]}, "collected_at": "2026-11-03T13:15:00+01:00", "connector": {"name": "trainset", "version": "0.2.0"}, "attributes": null}}
{"case_id": "sonde-03", "persona": "agence-1", "jour": "2026-11-04", "item": {"schema_version": "1.1", "item_id": "mail:agence-1-00062", "source": "mail", "provider": "demo", "owner_user_id": "u_train_agence_1", "title": "Budget publicité du trimestre", "snippet": "Thomas, J'ai besoin de ton budget pour le trimestre pour finaliser le dossier auprès de la direction. Pour que je puisse avancer la demande auprès de la direction, il me manque ton budget publicité sur le portail. Le délai pour la remise est le mercredi 4 novembre. N'hésite pas si tu as besoin d'éclaircissements. Merci d'avance. Yanis", "content_text": null, "created_at": "2026-11-03T09:32:00+01:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-03T09:32:00+01:00", "start_at": null, "end_at": null, "due_at": null, "completed": null, "participants": [{"name": "Yanis Nguyen", "email": "yanis.nguyen@immo-horizon.test", "role": "from"}, {"name": "Thomas Leroy", "email": "thomas.leroy@immo-horizon.test", "role": "to"}], "thread_id": "thr-agence-1-c021", "correlation_id": null, "native_importance": "normal", "is_read": false, "url": "https://mail.immo-horizon.test/owa/agence-1-00062", "acl": {"visible_to": ["u_train_agence_1"]}, "collected_at": "2026-11-03T09:32:00+01:00", "connector": {"name": "trainset", "version": "0.2.0"}, "attributes": null}}
{"case_id": "sonde-04", "persona": "sante-2", "jour": "2026-11-23", "item": {"schema_version": "1.1", "item_id": "mail:sante-2-00470", "source": "mail", "provider": "demo", "owner_user_id": "u_train_sante_2", "title": "Commande de matériel de soins", "snippet": "J'ai reçu confirmation de la commande du matériel de soins pour le bloc opératoire. J'ai pris note de la confirmation de la commande. Je reste disponible pour tout renseignement complémentaire. Merci ! Antoine", "content_text": null, "created_at": "2026-11-20T09:49:00+01:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-20T09:49:00+01:00", "start_at": null, "end_at": null, "due_at": null, "completed": null, "participants": [{"name": "Antoine Lopez", "email": "antoine.lopez@clinique-cedres.test", "role": "from"}, {"name": "Camille Roger", "email": "camille.roger@clinique-cedres.test", "role": "to"}], "thread_id": "thr-sante-2-info-469", "correlation_id": null, "native_importance": "normal", "is_read": false, "url": "https://mail.clinique-cedres.test/owa/sante-2-00470", "acl": {"visible_to": ["u_train_sante_2"]}, "collected_at": "2026-11-20T09:49:00+01:00", "connector": {"name": "trainset", "version": "0.2.0"}, "attributes": null}}
{"case_id": "sonde-05", "persona": "ecole-2", "jour": "2026-11-16", "item": {"schema_version": "1.1", "item_id": "mail:ecole-2-00346", "source": "mail", "provider": "demo", "owner_user_id": "u_train_ecole_2", "title": "Planning sorties Léo - confirmation urgente", "snippet": "Pourriez-vous confirmer que le planning des sorties est toujours d'actualité, afin de bien organiser les disponibilités de Léo pour le mardi 17 novembre ? Il est important de confirmer le planning rapidement, car cela impacte l'organisation de nos activités au plus vite. Je vous remercie par avance pour votre réponse rapide.", "content_text": null, "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:35:00+01:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-13T13:35:00+01:00", "start_at": null, "end_at": null, "due_at": null, "completed": null, "participants": [{"name": "Laura Perrin", "email": "laura.perrin@parents.de.leo.garnier.test", "role": "from"}, {"name": "Guillaume Perrin", "email": "guillaume.perrin@ecole-jferry.test", "role": "to"}], "thread_id": "thr-ecole-2-c103", "correlation_id": null, "native_importance": "normal", "is_read": false, "url": "https://mail.ecole-jferry.test/owa/ecole-2-00346", "acl": {"visible_to": ["u_train_ecole_2"]}, "collected_at": "2026-11-13T13:35:00+01:00", "connector": {"name": "trainset", "version": "0.2.0"}, "attributes": null}}
{"case_id": "sonde-06", "persona": "commercial-1", "jour": "2026-11-11", "item": {"schema_version": "1.1", "item_id": "mail:commercial-1-00325", "source": "mail", "provider": "demo", "owner_user_id": "u_train_commercial_1", "title": "Confirmation notes de frais commerciaux", "snippet": "Merci de confirmer avant vendredi 13 novembre que la politique actuelle concernant les notes de frais des commerciaux reste en vigueur. Nous organisons un prochain audit budgétaire et avons besoin de données comparatives sur les frais engagés par vos équipes. Vos informations nous permettront de réaliser une comparaison précise.", "content_text": null, "created_at": "2026-11-10T17:35:00+01:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-10T17:35:00+01:00", "start_at": null, "end_at": null, "due_at": null, "completed": null, "participants": [{"name": "Aurélie Faure", "email": "aurelie.faure@groupe.scolaire.pasteur.test", "role": "from"}, {"name": "David Lopez", "email": "david.lopez@lumen-equipements.test", "role": "to"}], "thread_id": "thr-commercial-1-c093", "correlation_id": null, "native_importance": "normal", "is_read": true, "url": "https://mail.lumen-equipements.test/owa/commercial-1-00325", "acl": {"visible_to": ["u_train_commercial_1"]}, "collected_at": "2026-11-10T17:35:00+01:00", "connector": {"name": "trainset", "version": "0.2.0"}, "attributes": null}}
{"case_id": "sonde-07", "persona": "daf-1", "jour": "2026-11-10", "item": {"schema_version": "1.1", "item_id": "mail:daf-1-00157", "source": "mail", "provider": "demo", "owner_user_id": "u_train_daf_1", "title": "Devis Logiciel Compta+", "snippet": "Pourrais-tu bien vouloir signer le devis Logiciel Compta+ d'ici mardi 10 novembre ? J'ai préparé le devis pour Logiciel Compta+ conformément à nos échanges précédents. Merci d'avance. Inès", "content_text": null, "created_at": "2026-11-09T11:14:00+01:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-09T11:14:00+01:00", "start_at": null, "end_at": null, "due_at": null, "completed": null, "participants": [{"name": "Inès Leroy", "email": "ines.leroy@groupe-ardent.test", "role": "from"}, {"name": "Céline Fournier", "email": "celine.fournier@groupe-ardent.test", "role": "to"}], "thread_id": "thr-daf-1-c047", "correlation_id": null, "native_importance": "normal", "is_read": true, "url": "https://mail.groupe-ardent.test/owa/daf-1-00157", "acl": {"visible_to": ["u_train_daf_1"]}, "collected_at": "2026-11-09T11:14:00+01:00", "connector": {"name": "trainset", "version": "0.2.0"}, "attributes": null}}
{"case_id": "sonde-08", "persona": "drh-1", "jour": "2026-11-04", "item": {"schema_version": "1.1", "item_id": "mail:drh-1-00052", "source": "mail", "provider": "demo", "owner_user_id": "u_train_drh_1", "title": "Planning des entretiens annuels", "snippet": "Nous suivons l'avancée de votre dossier de près. Pourriez-vous déposer le planning des entretiens annuels sur le portail, s'il vous plaît ? Rien ne presse Merci pour votre collaboration.", "content_text": null, "created_at": "2026-11-03T09:45:00+01:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-03T09:45:00+01:00", "start_at": null, "end_at": null, "due_at": null, "completed": null, "participants": [{"name": "Léa Roger", "email": "lea.roger@organisme.formapro.test", "role": "from"}, {"name": "Élodie Diallo", "email": "elodie.diallo@solvane.test", "role": "to"}], "thread_id": "thr-drh-1-c017", "correlation_id": null, "native_importance": "normal", "is_read": true, "url": "https://mail.solvane.test/owa/drh-1-00052", "acl": {"visible_to": ["u_train_drh_1"]}, "collected_at": "2026-11-03T09:45:00+01:00", "connector": {"name": "trainset", "version": "0.2.0"}, "attributes": null}}
{"case_id": "sonde-09", "persona": "ecole-2", "jour": "2026-11-18", "item": {"schema_version": "1.1", "item_id": "mail:ecole-2-00427", "source": "mail", "provider": "demo", "owner_user_id": "u_train_ecole_2", "title": "Budget de la coopérative", "snippet": "Le budget de la coopérative a été validé par la municipalité. Je t'informe donc que le budget est validé.", "content_text": null, "created_at": "2026-11-17T15:35:00+01:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-17T15:35:00+01:00", "start_at": null, "end_at": null, "due_at": null, "completed": null, "participants": [{"name": "Amina Blanc", "email": "amina.blanc@ecole-jferry.test", "role": "from"}, {"name": "Guillaume Perrin", "email": "guillaume.perrin@ecole-jferry.test", "role": "to"}], "thread_id": "thr-ecole-2-info-426", "correlation_id": null, "native_importance": "normal", "is_read": false, "url": "https://mail.ecole-jferry.test/owa/ecole-2-00427", "acl": {"visible_to": ["u_train_ecole_2"]}, "collected_at": "2026-11-17T15:35:00+01:00", "connector": {"name": "trainset", "version": "0.2.0"}, "attributes": null}}
{"case_id": "sonde-10", "persona": "operations-3", "jour": "2026-11-19", "item": {"schema_version": "1.1", "item_id": "mail:operations-3-00365", "source": "mail", "provider": "demo", "owner_user_id": "u_train_operations_3", "title": "Réunion - Budget maintenance 2027", "snippet": "Merci de venir à cette réunion avec une proposition concernant le budget maintenance 2027. Notre réunion du vendredi 20 novembre réunira l'équipe et la direction. Ce sujet sera au cœur de nos échanges.", "content_text": null, "created_at": "2026-11-18T11:16:00+01:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-18T11:16:00+01:00", "start_at": null, "end_at": null, "due_at": null, "completed": null, "participants": [{"name": "Sophie Guerin", "email": "sophie.guerin@valmont-agro.test", "role": "from"}, {"name": "Valérie Mercier", "email": "valerie.mercier@valmont-agro.test", "role": "to"}], "thread_id": "thr-operations-3-c105", "correlation_id": null, "native_importance": "normal", "is_read": false, "url": "https://mail.valmont-agro.test/owa/operations-3-00365", "acl": {"visible_to": ["u_train_operations_3"]}, "collected_at": "2026-11-18T11:16:00+01:00", "connector": {"name": "trainset", "version": "0.2.0"}, "attributes": null}}
{"case_id": "sonde-11", "persona": "daf-1", "jour": "2026-11-09", "item": {"schema_version": "1.1", "item_id": "mail:daf-1-00116", "source": "mail", "provider": "demo", "owner_user_id": "u_train_daf_1", "title": "Notes de frais du comité : signature urgente", "snippet": "Merci de bien vouloir signer les notes de frais du comité d'ici mardi 10 novembre. Urgent, cela bloque le remboursement des frais engagés par les membres du comité. Le dossier est disponible sur le serveur central. Merci ! Jérôme", "content_text": null, "created_at": "2026-11-06T08:37:00+01:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-06T08:37:00+01:00", "start_at": null, "end_at": null, "due_at": null, "completed": null, "participants": [{"name": "Jérôme Benali", "email": "jerome.benali@groupe-ardent.test", "role": "from"}, {"name": "Céline Fournier", "email": "celine.fournier@groupe-ardent.test", "role": "to"}], "thread_id": "thr-daf-1-c036", "correlation_id": null, "native_importance": "normal", "is_read": false, "url": "https://mail.groupe-ardent.test/owa/daf-1-00116", "acl": {"visible_to": ["u_train_daf_1"]}, "collected_at": "2026-11-06T08:37:00+01:00", "connector": {"name": "trainset", "version": "0.2.0"}, "attributes": null}}
{"case_id": "sonde-12", "persona": "qualite-3", "jour": "2026-11-23", "item": {"schema_version": "1.1", "item_id": "mail:qualite-3-00453", "source": "mail", "provider": "demo", "owner_user_id": "u_train_qualite_3", "title": "Relecture revue de direction, à te lancer quand tu veux !", "snippet": "J'ai fini la première version de la revue de direction pour le prochain trimestre. Elle est presque prête, mais j'aimerais bien avoir ton œil avisé dessus, tu sais toujours si bien repérer les détails qui me passent. Merci de la relire et de corriger directement dans le document, j'ai mis le fichier partagé avec le reste du dossier. Pas de souci si tu ne t'y mets pas avant vendredi 20 novembre. aucune urgence On peut en parler plus en détail quand tu auras un peu de temps. Passe une bonne…", "content_text": null, "created_at": "2026-11-20T09:49:00+01:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-20T09:49:00+01:00", "start_at": null, "end_at": null, "due_at": null, "completed": null, "participants": [{"name": "Camille Lefort", "email": "camille.lefort@precisium.test", "role": "from"}, {"name": "Rachid Denis", "email": "rachid.denis@precisium.test", "role": "to"}], "thread_id": "thr-qualite-3-c138", "correlation_id": null, "native_importance": "normal", "is_read": false, "url": "https://mail.precisium.test/owa/qualite-3-00453", "acl": {"visible_to": ["u_train_qualite_3"]}, "collected_at": "2026-11-20T09:49:00+01:00", "connector": {"name": "trainset", "version": "0.2.0"}, "attributes": null}}
{"case_id": "sonde-13", "persona": "collectivite-2", "jour": "2026-11-04", "item": {"schema_version": "1.1", "item_id": "mail:collectivite-2-00086", "source": "mail", "provider": "demo", "owner_user_id": "u_train_collectivite_2", "title": "Petite mise à jour sur le marché des espaces verts", "snippet": "Comme promis, je te fais un petit retour sur le marché d'entretien des espaces verts. Le marché est officiellement parti chez le client. On a eu un échange téléphonique avec leur responsable pour confirmer les détails et fixer les prochaines étapes. J'espère que tout se déroule bien de ton côté. Merci ! Hugo", "content_text": null, "created_at": "2026-11-04T08:04:00+01:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T08:04:00+01:00", "start_at": null, "end_at": null, "due_at": null, "completed": null, "participants": [{"name": "Hugo Fournier", "email": "hugo.fournier@ville-montclar.test", "role": "from"}, {"name": "Jérôme Perrin", "email": "jerome.perrin@ville-montclar.test", "role": "to"}], "thread_id": "thr-collectivite-2-info-85", "correlation_id": null, "native_importance": "normal", "is_read": false, "url": "https://mail.ville-montclar.test/owa/collectivite-2-00086", "acl": {"visible_to": ["u_train_collectivite_2"]}, "collected_at": "2026-11-04T08:04:00+01:00", "connector": {"name": "trainset", "version": "0.2.0"}, "attributes": null}}
{"case_id": "sonde-14", "persona": "projet_si-2", "jour": "2026-11-18", "item": {"schema_version": "1.1", "item_id": "mail:projet_si-2-00451", "source": "mail", "provider": "demo", "owner_user_id": "u_train_projet_si_2", "title": "Commande licences - portail", "snippet": "Tu peux déposer la commande sur le portail dédié, s'il te plaît. Aucune urgence, on a le temps de bien faire. Romain sera en copie pour suivre l'avancement.", "content_text": null, "created_at": "2026-11-17T11:05:00+01:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-17T11:05:00+01:00", "start_at": null, "end_at": null, "due_at": null, "completed": null, "participants": [{"name": "Cédric Dupont", "email": "cedric.dupont@numeria-services.test", "role": "from"}, {"name": "Mehdi Garnier", "email": "mehdi.garnier@numeria-services.test", "role": "to"}, {"name": "Romain Morin", "email": "romain.morin@numeria-services.test", "role": "cc"}], "thread_id": "thr-projet_si-2-c134", "correlation_id": null, "native_importance": "normal", "is_read": false, "url": "https://mail.numeria-services.test/owa/projet_si-2-00451", "acl": {"visible_to": ["u_train_projet_si_2"]}, "collected_at": "2026-11-17T11:05:00+01:00", "connector": {"name": "trainset", "version": "0.2.0"}, "attributes": null}}
{"case_id": "sonde-15", "persona": "chantier-1", "jour": "2026-11-23", "item": {"schema_version": "1.1", "item_id": "mail:chantier-1-00478", "source": "mail", "provider": "demo", "owner_user_id": "u_train_chantier_1", "title": "Point d'avancement : date ?", "snippet": "Le maître d'ouvrage souhaite un point sur les travaux. J'ai envoyé le questionnaire à Chloé. Tu proposes une date pour le point d'avancement ? Merci à toi, et merci à Chloé pour le questionnaire.", "content_text": null, "created_at": "2026-11-20T17:15:00+01:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-20T17:15:00+01:00", "start_at": null, "end_at": null, "due_at": null, "completed": null, "participants": [{"name": "Romain Chevalier", "email": "romain.chevalier@batir-ensemble.test", "role": "from"}, {"name": "Arnaud Benali", "email": "arnaud.benali@batir-ensemble.test", "role": "to"}, {"name": "Chloé Barbier", "email": "chloe.barbier@batir-ensemble.test", "role": "cc"}], "thread_id": "thr-chantier-1-c154", "correlation_id": null, "native_importance": "normal", "is_read": false, "url": "https://mail.batir-ensemble.test/owa/chantier-1-00478", "acl": {"visible_to": ["u_train_chantier_1"]}, "collected_at": "2026-11-20T17:15:00+01:00", "connector": {"name": "trainset", "version": "0.2.0"}, "attributes": null}}
